as many of the world's ultra wealthy  continue to grow their fortunes  mackenzie scott is giving hers away at a  faster rate than any billionaire in  modern history scott who is the ex-wife  of amazon founder jeff bezos is worth an  estimated 43.6 billion dollars that's a  drop of 9.4 billion or 18 percent from  her valuation last year  scott has promised to give away a  majority of her wealth which was  acquired in a 2019 divorce settlement  with bezos this pledge appears to be the  biggest factor behind her portfolio  value dropping  she has given away 12.5 billion dollars  to more than 1 250 organizations in less  than two years  this already has her ranked fifth on  forbes 2022 list of biggest lifetime  givers behind bill and melinda gates and  michael bloomberg who have been giving  away money for decades  scott has given to both small grassroots  organizations and large established  non-profits for a number of causes  including gender equity racial justice  reproductive rights and the arts once  the donations are finalized the  organizations can spend them however  they see fit her single largest donation  to date was this year to habitat for  humanity for 436 million dollars she  also made a big donation in 2022 to the  boys and girls club of america and  planned parenthood despite scott's  generosity she's still the fourth  richest woman in the world according to  forbes calculations this puts her behind  l'oreal air francoise bettencourt myers  walmart heir alice walton and koch  industries air julia coke  [Music]
 

